# Asset archive policy

Before deleting or replacing any file in `src/assets/` (except under `src/assets/archive/`):

1. Create `src/assets/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<short-reason>/`.
2. Move or copy the outgoing asset into that folder (keep the original filename).
3. Add/update `MANIFEST.md` in that folder describing what was retired and what replaces it.
4. Only then write the new asset into `src/assets/`.

See `src/assets/archive/README.md`. Never permanently delete an active art asset without an archive copy.
